Description: Tracks covariance eigenspaces with the TRACE (Trajectory Recognition
    and Association of Covariance Eigenvectors) method. Produces independently
    checked bounds on eigenvalue strengths, spectral projectors and their changes
    through time. Supports conditional temporal Gaussian calibration, weighted
    window error envelopes and geometry of positive-definite covariance tubes.
    Results retain unresolved bounds and ambiguous associations. Statistical
    statements remain conditional on sampling, dependence and regularity
    assumptions supplied by the caller.
